%% Figure 4.8 – State Machine Diagram: batch.status (Batch) · v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4
%% Same content as CrabShare_State_Machines.drawio, page "batch.status" (generated by gen-state.js, do not edit by hand).
%% «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code (class planned, grey dashed) · (not written by code) = CHECK value never written (class notwritten, orange dashed).
%% Labels are short (trigger [guard] / effect); the full label of each transition is in the %% line under it.
%% Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.
stateDiagram-v2
  state fundingClose <<choice>>
  state Harvesting {
    state "Delivering «planned» phase" as Delivering
    state "FinalOrder «planned» phase" as FinalOrder
    [*] --> Delivering
    Delivering --> FinalOrder : «planned» after(SalesWindowDays) / final-order reminder · UC51
    %% «planned» after(SalesWindowDays) [harvest Completed] / final-order reminder (job) · UC51
  }
  [*] --> Draft : / create batch · UC07
  %% / created by create batch (Owner) · UC07
  Draft --> PendingApproval : submit [cost complete] / cost Submitted · UC07
  %% submit (Owner) [Standard Cost Draft with MortalityReserve, schedule complete] / cost version Submitted · UC07 «planned» [price per kg (UC49 hint), floor price, survival threshold and tiers, delivery radius set]
  PendingApproval --> Draft : request revision [reason] · UC08
  %% request revision (Admin) [reason] / next save creates a new cost version · UC08
  PendingApproval --> Rejected : reject [reason] · UC08
  %% reject (Admin) [reason] / rejection_reason · UC08
  PendingApproval --> Funding : approve [one Submitted cost] / lock Standard Cost, open funding · UC08
  %% approve (Admin) [operator Approved, one Submitted cost version, fee tier matches] / lock Standard Cost, batch account Open, tranches Planned, funding window · UC08 «planned» also approve floor price and remuneration tiers; lock price per kg and floor price; snapshot the minimum pre-order ratio (UC41)
  Funding --> fundingClose : funding close (job) · UC10
  %% funding close (job) at deadline or max capital · UC10
  fundingClose --> Funding : [capital ≥ min viable AND pre-order ratio ≥ minimum «planned»] / capital_share
  %% [confirmed ≥ min_viable_capital AND pre-order ratio ≥ minimum «planned»] / capital_share snapshot, capital_closed_at
  fundingClose --> Cancelled : [else] / refund contributions and deposits
  %% [else] / refund every Confirmed contribution and every customer deposit «planned», void unsigned contracts
  Funding --> Stocked : record stocking [capital closed, contracts signed] / boxes Occupied · UC17
  %% record stocking (Owner) [capital closed, every contract FullySigned, boxes = seed_quantity, all Available] / boxes Occupied, crabs Growing · UC17 «planned» only the funded boxes are stocked
  Stocked --> InProduction : / same transaction · UC17
  InProduction --> Harvesting : start harvest / harvest Open · UC22
  %% start harvest (Owner) [no Open harvest session] / harvest Open, harvest_started_at · UC22
  Harvesting --> Settlement : run settlement calculation / settlement Draft · UC38
  %% run settlement calculation (Admin triggers, engine computes) [capital shares, Locked cost] / settlement Draft · UC38 «planned» [final order recorded ∧ every order past its return window]
  Settlement --> Closed : last payout Succeeded / closed_at · UC39, UC40
  %% last investor payout Succeeded / settlement PaidOut → Closed, closed_at · UC39, UC40
  Rejected --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  Closed --> [*]
  note right of Funding
    Funding - «planned» do / bulk pre-orders (UC27)
    «planned» on Funding → Stocked - only the funded boxes are stocked
  end note
  note right of Harvesting
    Delivering is a «planned» business phase of Harvesting, not a status value - do / harvest per box (UC22), do / deliver, weigh, pay balance (UC29, UC30), do / invoiced sales (UC50)
    FinalOrder is a «planned» business phase of Harvesting, not a status value - entry / final-order reminder (job), do / final order ≥ floor price (UC51)
    «planned» Delivering → FinalOrder - after(SalesWindowDays) [harvest Completed] / final-order reminder (job)
    «planned» on Harvesting → Settlement - [final order recorded ∧ every order past its return window]
  end note
  note right of Draft
    «planned» on Draft → PendingApproval - [price per kg (UC49 hint), floor price, survival threshold and tiers, delivery radius set]
    «planned» on fundingClose → Funding - pre-order ratio ≥ minimum «planned»
    «planned» on fundingClose → Cancelled - and every customer deposit «planned»
    «planned», the minimum pre-order ratio, Funding keeps its value (capital_closed_at set). «planned» if capital closes between the minimum and the target, only the funded boxes go into production, capital that cannot be converted into boxes is refunded, and settlement deducts the locked Standard Cost of the funded boxes only.
    «planned» business phases inside Harvesting, derived from the order states, they are not status values and need no new CHECK value. Not implemented - early liquidation, Rejected → Draft resubmission.
  end note
  note right of PendingApproval
    «planned» on PendingApproval → Funding - also approve floor price and remuneration tiers, lock price per kg and floor price, snapshot the minimum pre-order ratio (UC41)
  end note
  %% Created by create batch (Owner) only if: the Owner's operator is Approved (UC07).
  %% Rules live in the services (422 batch.invalid_transition); the database only checks the value list (ck_batch_status) — the architecture notes in the repository describe a DB trigger that does not exist.
  %% Funding closes when the minimum viable capital is reached (as in code) and, «planned», the minimum pre-order ratio; Funding keeps its value (capital_closed_at set). «planned» if capital closes between the minimum and the target, only the funded boxes go into production, capital that cannot be converted into boxes is refunded, and settlement deducts the locked Standard Cost of the funded boxes only.
  %% Today in code, submit and approve also need an offtake price per grade and pre-orders open only while InProduction from a Published listing; replaced in v1.4 by the price per kg, the floor price and bulk pre-orders while Funding. Stocking today needs boxes = seed_quantity.
  %% Settlement: the Admin triggers the calculation and the engine (SettlementCalculator) computes it. Delivering and FinalOrder are «planned» business phases inside Harvesting, derived from the order states; they are not status values and need no new CHECK value. Not implemented: early liquidation, Rejected → Draft resubmission.
  classDef planned stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#64748b,color:#64748b,fill:#f8fafc
  classDef notwritten stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#9a3412,fill:#f1f5f9
  classDef terminal fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b
  class Delivering, FinalOrder planned
  class Rejected, Cancelled, Closed terminal
